   "text": "Borderless, in thirty seconds.",
   "url": "file:///home/claude/v4/a/09_01.mp3"
  },
  {
   "text": "Step one: tell it why you're learning.",
   "url": "file:///home/claude/v4/a/09_02.mp3"
  },
  {
   "text": "A new job. A partner's family. A move abroad. An exam.",
   "url": "file:///home/claude/v4/a/09_03.mp3"
  },
  {
   "text": "Step two: a short test finds your level.",
   "url": "file:///home/claude/v4/a/09_04.mp3"
  },
  {
   "text": "Step three: it writes your first lesson. Just one.",
   "url": "file:///home/claude/v4/a/09_05.mp3"
  },
  {
   "text": "Finish it, and the next one is built on how you did.",
   "url": "file:///home/claude/v4/a/09_06.mp3"
  },
  {
   "text": "Fifty lessons, about your reason, at your level.",
   "url": "file:///home/claude/v4/a/09_07.mp3"
  },
  {
   "text": "Seventy-four languages.",
   "url": "file:///home/claude/v4/a/09_08.mp3"
  },
  {
   "text": "One course. Yours.",
   "url": "file:///home/claude/v4/a/09_09.mp3"
  },
  {
   "text": "That's the app.",
   "url": "file:///home/claude/v4/a/09_10.mp3"
  }
